e_name": "megatron_01.png", "id": "1358470739616264", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314660_1358470742949597_3147146377544014176_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m-OlKTEKutEQ7kNvwHgRy4M&_nc_oc=AdoNWeYIwpmcezjrLg0v1ZxTUu4YHe2V-17Ef5cXsihKjXASTs2GA_6MKplUbNt-bmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO8uNtaIPxh_viazGJ16zLA9d_yL8_VeYiH-kljFFRjTA&oe=6AC66511"}, {"file_name": "Starscream_and_his_Seekers.png", "id": "994313196919470", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_994313200252803_1503119107445332137_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wlo67LSYkZEQ7kNvwGynfTF&_nc_oc=AdrX0DW9x5pXzNV_CYItVXw6mq-_rkf20cREW2mZIE2YNOElFaTxNaDTI4fSYeNU980&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPaiGp9EpiCCNqQ8CdwFHm9mC52el3RzxhmfzKo42MghQ&oe=6AC65917"}, {"file_name": "Bumblebee.png", "id": "2128504891881436", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308050_2128504895214769_6467520607096069724_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=scW_QDgt9a8Q7kNvwFF0lxG&_nc_oc=Adq4FPw4I4Jug7uJQMdoqS5mxEYD2lLMh2oXEhpIykrIWj23mV4AaMO6uVdoib_beLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPPI-0hesiNrbMj8vDwwr5e8I3TnHQY4vUW30h6VZbT3w&oe=6AC6460C"}, {"file_name": "Megatron_vs_Optimus_01.png", "id": "1330755489008246", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303585_1330755492341579_2499204447401839194_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iESIsPFcOLQQ7kNvwHjWViK&_nc_oc=AdpNhfytawJ_xC0DE_feCsFih3wyVBrNnP7QampdoL214UMNzYdPMobinBzhPWNeCKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1zIZ_Y_TnR_RQIjlhBsMKm6uGFKbRt7xF6PaOjXmg0A&oe=6AC65881"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Couverture paysage.png", "id": "1582839249854410", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1582839253187743_2914338291293560918_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w_4dBeBBIWMQ7kNvwGa3_Hh&_nc_oc=AdrTcwgvN5y7rNF_JS6qhMFqYRRLkjZ1wH5HxtpZqdr84-XaLjC6t-Ljzunmtgw2se4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO8H3qllL8yj9WP7Fz84xnPTFVxC5uww286Nr64ETJBOQ&oe=6AC65AD9"}, "display_name": "Transformers Beyond Reality Redux", "keywords": ["transformers"], "long_description": "Welcome to the fight against the Decepticons, human! Your new exosuit and weaponry have been built using a hybrid of Cybertronian and Terran tech. Put it on so we can kick some Decepticon tail-rudder!\n\nThe Decepticons have discovered an incredibly powerful but completely unstable and corrupting energy source called Synthetic Dark Energon. With this power, they can finally take over their home planet Cybertron and will destroy Earth in the process.\n\nEarth scientists have been working with the Autobots, reverse engineering their highly advanced Cybertonian technology and combining it with human ingenuity. The result is an incredible Exosuit and weaponry, powered by Energon, that will finally even the odds for humans to take on the Decepticons in a pitched battle.\n\n- Access advanced upgradeable Cybertronian tech designed for humans including miniguns, beam guns, swords, shields, and laser blasters.\n\n- Dynamic equipment load-outs that let players choose their preferred style of gameplay. Go full offense, defense, or a mix of both.\n\n- Frenetic non-stop action battling through swarms of Insecticons.\n\n- Formidable boss battles against epic Decepticons such as Shockwave, Megatron, Starscream and Soundwave.\n\n- Highly detailed graphics and immersive gameplay that gives the sense of scale that so many generations of TRANSFORMERS fans have always wanted.\n", "short_description": "Battle Decepticons as a human in this arcade-style first-person VR shooter."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gCPA4J34JxH5sk3Q2j7tbPD_L1_px9GIuSyuU